| Review code | `.agency-agents/engineering/engineering-code-reviewer.md` |
| Tối ưu truy vấn, cơ sở dữ liệu | `.agency-agents/engineering/engineering-database-optimizer.md` |
| CI/CD, hạ tầng, tự động hóa triển khai | `.agency-agents/engineering/engineering-devops-automator.md` |
| Quy trình Git, branch, commit | `.agency-agents/engineering/engineering-git-workflow-master.md` |
| Prototype nhanh | `.agency-agents/engineering/engineering-rapid-prototyper.md` |
| Ứng dụng mobile | `.agency-agents/engineering/engineering-mobile-app-builder.md` |
| Ứng dụng desktop | `.agency-agents/engineering/engineering-desktop-app-engineer.md` |
| Độ tin cậy, vận hành (SRE) | `.agency-agents/engineering/engineering-sre.md` |
| Tài liệu kỹ thuật | `.agency-agents/engineering/engineering-technical-writer.md` |
| Làm quen codebase mới | `.agency-agents/engineering/engineering-codebase-onboarding-engineer.md` |
| Viết và tự động hóa test | `.agency-agents/testing/testing-test-automation-engineer.md` |
| Kiểm thử API | `.agency-agents/testing/testing-api-tester.md` |
| Đo hiệu năng | `.agency-agents/testing/testing-performance-benchmarker.md` |
